:false,"text":"Having underwent a factory reset before coming to Kuroneko-tei, she is quite clueless when it comes to society."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Nonetheless, she is a very earnest person. Always smiling at everyone around her, she takes care of everything with full attention, and is loved by the people around her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Sometimes she can be so carried away by her fantasies that she doesn't hear what people say."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Favorite food: Anpan"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Dream: Discovering her calling"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c94291"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d0/d061890a26b9c11592a24b0c38a6337a752243034719affbc98e676276f54be4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d4/d4a07ee5cbb4848ba443d350427a9b314f48800a103d22328fcca00ecd441c28.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"和氣 あず未","creatorId":"vndb:s18309","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s18309","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s18309","name":"和氣 あず未","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:86194","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c94292","characterName":"月下","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c94292"},"originalCharacterName":"月下","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"128"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A former reconnaissance doll with a childlike body."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a coarse mouth, just as a soldier would."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She dutifully does what she's told, but her attitude is aloof and